# Effect Schema v1 Design

Canonical implementation: `github.com/joelhooks/content-grill` → `src/domain/`, `src/ports/`, `src/machines/`.

## Locked decisions (Joel, 2026-08-19)

- **Hexagonal** — domain schemas at center; `ReceiptStore`, `ContextSearch`, `SlurpSource` as Effect `Context.Service` ports; adapters per source.
- **ContextReceipt** — `Schema.TaggedUnion` with `_tag` + mirrored `source` field: `Brain`, `XPost`, `AgentSession`, plus v2-reserved `GmailThread`, `SlackMessage`, `GranolaMeeting`, `GitActivity`.
- **PrivacyTier** — `operator` | `work` | `public`; default query = work + public; adapters redact before write.
- **TopicPrompt** — title, whyNow, receiptIds, digDeeperQuestion; `TopicPromptBatch.generatesCopy` literal `false`.
- **Slurp lifecycle** — `SlurpCursor` + `SlurpRun` schemas; XState machine in `src/machines/slurp-run.ts` maps to cursor `status`.

## v1 scope

Slurpers: `brain`, `x_post` only. CLI stub: `doctor`, `slurp status` (store/adapters not wired).

## Follow-ups

- String length filters via Effect v4 filter API (bounds documented as constants today).
- Storage adapter (blocked step: Decide Local Storage Backend).
- Scheduler (blocked step: Decide Slurp Scheduler on Flagg).
